DUSD::mint
├── given contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with IsPaused
├── given caller is not authorized minter
│   └── it should revert with DUSDNotAuthorized
└── given caller is authorized minter
    ├── when minting would exceed ceiling
    │   └── it should revert with DUSDInvalidInput
    ├── when to address is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with ERC20InvalidReceiver
    ├── when amount is zero
    │   ├── it should mint zero tokens successfully
    │   ├── it should not increase minter's minted amount
    │   └── it should emit Transfer event from zero address to recipient
    ├── when amount is valid and within ceiling
    │   ├── it should increase total supply by the amount
    │   ├── it should increase recipient balance by the amount
    │   ├── it should increase minter's minted amount by the amount
    │   └── it should emit Transfer event from zero address to recipient
    └── when minting to contract address
        ├── it should mint tokens successfully to contract
        ├── it should increase total supply by the amount
        ├── it should increase contract address balance by the amount
        ├── it should increase minter's minted amount by the amount
        └── it should emit Transfer event from zero address to contract